{"3301840":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"fanxiu","steam_appid":3301840,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan Xiu is an idle cultivation game. You play a mere mortal starting at the Qi Refining stage, embarking on the long road to immortality. No tedious grinding, no daily check-in pressure — even with the game closed, your character keeps meditating and ascending in their cave abode. Let go, and let the Dao flow. When you return, your bags are full.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☯ Idle Cultivation<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully automated progression: cultivation accumulates while idle, realms break through on their own<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log in and harvest: elixirs, artifacts, and treasures drop naturally over time — every bag opening is a surprise<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pace, your way: one minute a day or weeks untouched — the Great Dao never rushes you<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Rare Drops, Jackpot Moments<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple rarity tiers, from common relics to legendary treasures, each with clearly defined drop rates<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-value items drop at low odds — every &quot;ding&quot; could be your lucky moment<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What drops is yours forever, delivered straight into your Steam Inventory<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒ Craft &amp; Upgrade — No Luck Required<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse low-tier materials upward, three into one, nine refinements into one — even scraps can become peerless treasures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through accumulation, not luck: the longer you idle, the more materials you hold, the wider your crafting paths<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression lines in parallel — keep what you need, sell the rest<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Steam Market, Free Trading<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items earned in-game go directly into your Steam Inventory<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List them on the Steam Community Market, trade freely, and set your own prices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle your way not just to immortality, but to real earnings — someone else's ceiling is your daily income<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Limited-Time Events, Exclusive Collectibles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.poster.avif?t=1793864914\" width=1050 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.webm?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.mp4?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.poster.avif?t=1793864914\" width=1050 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.webm?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.mp4?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular holiday and version events featuring exclusive cosmetics and commemorative items<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gone for good once the event ends — maximum scarcity, high collectible and market value<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early birds stake their claim — first to cultivate, first to prosper<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who This Game Is For<br>If you enjoy cultivation fantasy in bite-sized sessions, love the satisfaction of collecting and progression, relish waking up to a backpack full of loot, or simply want to try buying low and selling high on the Steam Market — there's a meditation cushion in Fan Xiu with your name on it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand roads lead to the Great Dao — idling is one of them. One click to begin your cultivation. Time handles the rest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Community Group: 1101152370<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan Xiu is an idle cultivation game. You play a mere mortal starting at the Qi Refining stage, embarking on the long road to immortality. No tedious grinding, no daily check-in pressure — even with the game closed, your character keeps meditating and ascending in their cave abode. Let go, and let the Dao flow. When you return, your bags are full.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☯ Idle Cultivation<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully automated progression: cultivation accumulates while idle, realms break through on their own<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log in and harvest: elixirs, artifacts, and treasures drop naturally over time — every bag opening is a surprise<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pace, your way: one minute a day or weeks untouched — the Great Dao never rushes you<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Rare Drops, Jackpot Moments<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple rarity tiers, from common relics to legendary treasures, each with clearly defined drop rates<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-value items drop at low odds — every &quot;ding&quot; could be your lucky moment<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What drops is yours forever, delivered straight into your Steam Inventory<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒ Craft &amp; Upgrade — No Luck Required<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse low-tier materials upward, three into one, nine refinements into one — even scraps can become peerless treasures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through accumulation, not luck: the longer you idle, the more materials you hold, the wider your crafting paths<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression lines in parallel — keep what you need, sell the rest<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Steam Market, Free Trading<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items earned in-game go directly into your Steam Inventory<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List them on the Steam Community Market, trade freely, and set your own prices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle your way not just to immortality, but to real earnings — someone else's ceiling is your daily income<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Limited-Time Events, Exclusive Collectibles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.poster.avif?t=1793864914\" width=1050 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.webm?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/94767723bab7da2a894c1ce29c58e48b.mp4?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.poster.avif?t=1793864914\" width=1050 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.webm?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3301840\/extras\/6a1fef498eace4add75c4b767ff93a0f.mp4?t=1793864914\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular holiday and version events featuring exclusive cosmetics and commemorative items<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gone for good once the event ends — maximum scarcity, high collectible and market value<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early birds stake their claim — first to cultivate, first to prosper<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who This Game Is For<br>If you enjoy cultivation fantasy in bite-sized sessions, love the satisfaction of collecting and progression, relish waking up to a backpack full of loot, or simply want to try buying low and selling high on the Steam Market — there's a meditation cushion in Fan Xiu with your name on it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three thousand roads lead to the Great Dao — idling is one of them. One click to begin your cultivation. Time handles the rest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Community Group: 1101152370<\/p>","short_description":"Fan Xiu is an idle cultivation game. Break through realms while elixirs, artifacts, and rare treasures drop over time. Every item you earn can be freely listed and traded on the Steam Market — idle your way to immortality, and to real profit. Limited-time events regularly drop exclusive items","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https: